### Posts Variables
@postUrl = http://localhost:5100/api/posts

### P1. Create Post (POST)
POST {{postUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Hello World",
  "content": "My first bulletin board post",
  "postID": 1
}

### P2. Create Post 2 (POST)
POST {{postUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Second Post",
  "content": "Another post for the board",
  "postID": 2
}

### P3. Get All Posts (GET)
GET {{postUrl}}

### P4. Get Post by ID (GET)
GET {{postUrl}}/1

### P5. Update Post (PUT)
PUT {{postUrl}}/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Hello World (edited)",
  "content": "Updated content",
  "postID": 1
}

### P6. Delete Post (DELETE)
DELETE {{postUrl}}/2

### P7. Missing Post (GET - 404 Not Found)
GET {{postUrl}}/999